{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"root","type":"text","x":810,"y":0,"width":380,"height":190,"text":"# rw-scripts `scripts.sh`\n**v1.6.0** · 3320 строк · bash\n\n`show_main_menu` · L3272\nцикл: `show_dashboard` (L72) → `auto_check_update` (L39, один раз) → `case`\n\nвход: `# ЗАПУСК` L3320","color":"6"},
		{"id":"infra","type":"text","x":1260,"y":0,"width":420,"height":190,"text":"## Окружение\n- `install.sh` → `~/.local/bin/rw-scripts` (sudo-check, зависимости)\n- `uninstall.sh`\n- `~/.config/remnawave/lang.conf`\n- `~/.local/share/remnawave/` → `version.txt`, `ports.json`\n- `tr_text` L98 — словарь RU/EN (~430 строк)\n- UI: `show_banner`, `loading_bar`, `print_submenu_header`","color":"0"},
		{"id":"lib","type":"text","x":330,"y":0,"width":420,"height":190,"text":"## Общие хелперы\n- `ensure_jq` L23, `ensure_xxd` L6\n- `detect_firewall` L5 (ufw/firewalld/iptables)\n- `_pkg_install` L42\n- ports.json: `init_ports_file`, `add_/remove_port_*`, `sync_ports_with_firewall`","color":"0"},
		{"id":"g1","type":"text","x":0,"y":330,"width":300,"height":110,"text":"## 🆔 Short ID & Flags\n`submenu_id_flags · L1541`\nпункт главного меню: **1**","color":"1"},
		{"id":"g1-generate_ids","type":"text","x":0,"y":480,"width":300,"height":70,"text":"`generate_ids`\nL1104 · генерация Short ID (xxd)"},
		{"id":"g1-country_lookup","type":"text","x":0,"y":575,"width":300,"height":70,"text":"`country_lookup`\nL1134 · поиск страны/флага (countries.csv, iso_to_flag)"},
		{"id":"g2","type":"text","x":340,"y":330,"width":300,"height":110,"text":"## 📊 Resource Monitor\n`submenu_monitor · L1563`\nпункт главного меню: **2**","color":"2"},
		{"id":"g2-show_memory","type":"text","x":340,"y":480,"width":300,"height":70,"text":"`show_memory`\nL548"},
		{"id":"g2-launch_htop","type":"text","x":340,"y":575,"width":300,"height":70,"text":"`launch_htop`\nL571"},
		{"id":"g2-show_system_info","type":"text","x":340,"y":670,"width":300,"height":70,"text":"`show_system_info`\nL502"},
		{"id":"g3","type":"text","x":680,"y":330,"width":300,"height":110,"text":"## 🌐 Network & Ports\n`submenu_network → port_management · L1050`\nпункт главного меню: **3**","color":"3"},
		{"id":"g3-open_port","type":"text","x":680,"y":480,"width":300,"height":70,"text":"`open_port`\nL775"},
		{"id":"g3-close_port","type":"text","x":680,"y":575,"width":300,"height":70,"text":"`close_port`\nL857"},
