		{"id":"g3-list_ports","type":"text","x":680,"y":765,"width":300,"height":70,"text":"`list_ports`\nL973"},
		{"id":"g3-show_firewall_status","type":"text","x":680,"y":860,"width":300,"height":70,"text":"`show_firewall_status`\nL1018"},
		{"id":"g4","type":"text","x":1020,"y":330,"width":300,"height":110,"text":"## 🛠 Maintenance\n`submenu_maintenance · L2369`\nпункт главного меню: **4**","color":"4"},
		{"id":"g4-check_update","type":"text","x":1020,"y":480,"width":300,"height":70,"text":"`check_update`\nL1170 · сравнение с version.txt в репо"},
		{"id":"g4-apt_update_upgrade","type":"text","x":1020,"y":575,"width":300,"height":70,"text":"`apt_update_upgrade`\nL2291"},
		{"id":"g4-delete_self","type":"text","x":1020,"y":670,"width":300,"height":70,"text":"`delete_self`\nL1213 · удаление rw-scripts"},
		{"id":"g4-n0","type":"text","x":1020,"y":765,"width":300,"height":250,"text":"### 🧹 submenu_cleaner · L2719\n1. полная уборка (`_do_clean_all`)\n2. apt\n3. журналы\n4. docker\n5. /tmp\n6. snap\n7. `_disk_analyzer`\n\nинспектор: `_disk_inspector` (/var/log, /var/lib/docker, /var/cache/apt, /tmp, /opt/remnawave)","color":"4"},
		{"id":"g4-n1","type":"text","x":1020,"y":1040,"width":300,"height":190,"text":"### 🧠 submenu_memory · L2901\n`_mem_install_hybrid` (zram+swap)\n`_mem_install_zram`\n`_mem_install_swap`\n`_mem_remove_all`\n`_mem_show_status`\n`_mem_show_instructions`","color":"4"},
		{"id":"g4-n2","type":"text","x":1020,"y":1255,"width":300,"height":190,"text":"### 🔍 submenu_scanner · L3232\n`_scan_single`\n`_scan_mass`\n`_scan_manage_list`\n`_scan_reports`\n`_scan_install`\n(`_scan_ensure`, `_scan_analyze`)","color":"4"},
		{"id":"g5","type":"text","x":1360,"y":330,"width":300,"height":110,"text":"## 🖥 Server Setup\n`submenu_server · L2266`\nпункт главного меню: **5**","color":"5"},
		{"id":"g5-change_ssh_port","type":"text","x":1360,"y":480,"width":300,"height":70,"text":"`change_ssh_port`\nL1225"},
		{"id":"g5-install_zapret","type":"text","x":1360,"y":575,"width":300,"height":70,"text":"`install_zapret`\nL1893"},
		{"id":"g5-n0","type":"text","x":1360,"y":670,"width":300,"height":260,"text":"### 🚀 submenu_hysteria2 · L1857\n1. `install_hysteria2`\n2. `remove_hysteria2`\n3. `edit_hysteria2_config`\n4. `manage_hysteria2_service`\n5. `show_hysteria2_logs`\n6. `check_hysteria2_version`\n7. `update_hysteria2`\n8. `setup_hysteria2_remnanode` (Xray inbound, `_hy2r_open_udp`)","color":"5"},
		{"id":"g5-n1","type":"text","x":1360,"y":955,"width":300,"height":230,"text":"### ☁️ submenu_warp · L2112\n1. `install_warp` (`_run_spinner`, `_warp_prepare_repo`, `_warp_configure`, `_warp_connect_wait`)\n2. `warp_status` (`_warp_country`)\n3. `warp_disconnect`\n4. `warp_connect`\n5. `uninstall_warp`","color":"5"},
		{"id":"g6","type":"text","x":1700,"y":330,"width":300,"height":110,"text":"## 📦 Сторонние скрипты\n`submenu_thirdparty · L2243`\nпункт главного меню: **6**","color":"6"},
